<title>USA: Ford November US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Ford November US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   113,471	   127,888	    -11.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 175,606	   166,198	     +5.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 1,697	     3,276	    -48.2</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	 1,574,819	 1,608,168	     -2.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,933,606	 1,865,182	     +2.9</p>
<p> Import Car		35,804	    57,167	    -37.8</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
